---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout description="Terms and Conditions for using Stuff8 and the Marketplace.">
  <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-14 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-xs sm:p-10">
      <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-3 border-b border-slate-200 pb-7">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-brand-700">Stuff8</p>
        <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-navy-900 sm:text-4xl">Terms and Conditions</h1>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-base">These are the ground rules to keep Stuff8 pleasant, safe, and useful for everyone. By creating an account or using our services, you agree to these terms.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-base">
        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">1. About Stuff8</h2>
          <p>Stuff8 helps you keep track of your personal inventory and then list the items you actually want to sell on the Marketplace. We provide the place to record items, discover items, and start negotiations—we are not the party selling or buying your items.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">2. Your account, your responsibility</h2>
          <p>Use your correct name, username, and email. Keep your password safe and do not share account access with others. You need to verify your email before you can list items or start negotiating with other users.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">3. Items you may and may not list</h2>
          <p>Make sure the items you upload are yours or that you have the right to sell them. Descriptions, photos, prices, and condition must be honest—no need to overcomplicate, the important thing is not to mislead.</p>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-rose-200 bg-rose-50 p-4 text-rose-950">
            <p class="font-bold">Do not list items or content that:</p>
            <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
              <li>violates the law, is stolen, counterfeit, or infringes others' rights;</li>
              <li>relates to narcotics, weapons, explosives, or dangerous goods;</li>
              <li>is obscene, sexually exploitative, hateful, violent, or harassing;</li>
              <li>involves fraud, phishing, spam, gambling, or solicitations of suspicious transactions; and</li>
              <li>violates other rules applicable in your region.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">4. Negotiate casually, stay polite</h2>
          <p>The offer and chat features are built to help you talk comfortably about items. Do not spam, intimidate, spread other people's personal data, or steer the conversation in a way that makes others unsafe. The price you offer is not automatically a completed transaction—the agreement still rests with the buyer and the item's owner.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">5. Transactions and risk</h2>
          <p>Stuff8 is not an escrow, courier, or payment intermediary. Before proceeding with a transaction, carefully check the item, the other party's identity, the payment method, and the meeting place. Avoid sharing sensitive data such as passwords, OTP codes, or payment card information.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">6. Your photos, documents, and content</h2>
          <p>You keep ownership of the content you upload. You grant Stuff8 limited permission to store and display it solely so the inventory, Marketplace, and chat features can work. Do not upload files that violate copyright, privacy, or the law.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-900">7. We can keep this space safe</h2>
          <p>If there is activity that violates the rules or puts other users at risk, Stuff8 may restrict, hide, or remove related content and accounts. We may also update the service or these terms when necessary. If there are important changes, we will surface them in the app.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5 text-slate-700">
          <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900">The bottom line</h2>
          <p class="mt-1">Record honestly, sell safely, and talk with mutual respect. If you're unsure whether an item or action is safe or not, it's better not to post it in the first place.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
